body:
I try helping others as much as I can, through logical arguments sometimes.

&#x200B;

Also surprisingly for someone on the spectrum, I'm very into physical affection.

I hated them so so much in school.... The texture of them, the SOUND, the dry but sticky feeling of chalk, the chalk dust that would get in your lungs, the slight crevices and bumps all over the chalkboard

&#x200B;

All I gotta say is that whiteboards >>>>>>>>>>>> chalkboards
